<title>USA: Commercial Net declares qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>Commercial Net declares qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ORLANDO, Fla. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commercial Net Lease Realty Inc said Thursday its board declared a quarterly dividend of $0.30 a share, payable February 14, record January 31.</p>
<p>The real estate investment trust also said it is launching a dividend reinvestment plan. It said shareholders may invest their dividends in Commercial Net stock at a purchase price of 97 percent of the market price.</p>
<p>The company owns 195 retail properties in 31 states that are covered with long-term leases.</p>
